-- src:1903 | (4) Proceeds
-- src:1904 | The proceeds from any sale of forfeited property and any monies forfeited under this subsection shall be used—
-- src:1905 | (A) first, to reimburse the Department of Justice for the costs incurred by the Department to initiate and complete the forfeiture proceeding;
-- src:1906 | (B) second, to reimburse the Department of Agriculture Office of Inspector General for any costs the Office incurred in the law enforcement effort resulting in the forfeiture;
-- src:1907 | (C) third, to reimburse any Federal or State law enforcement agency for any costs incurred in the law enforcement effort resulting in the forfeiture; and
-- src:1908 | (D) fourth, by the Secretary to carry out the approval, reauthorization, and compliance investigations of retail stores and wholesale food concerns under section 2018 of this title.
@ref s 2024(f)(4) how the proceeds are applied (src:1903-1908)
-- In plain words: the proceeds of the sale of forfeited property, and money forfeited, pay in order: (A) the Department of Justice's costs of the forfeiture proceeding, (B) the Agriculture Inspector General's costs of the law enforcement effort,
-- (C) any Federal or State law enforcement agency's costs of that effort, and (D) fourth, the Secretary's use for approval, reauthorization and compliance investigations of retail stores and wholesale food concerns under section 2018.
-- Each reimbursement is capped at the cost, and (D) takes what is left (NOTES.md, fork F-2024-2).
GIVEN `the proceeds from any sale of forfeited property and any monies forfeited` IS A NUMBER
      `the costs incurred by the Department of Justice to initiate and complete the forfeiture proceeding` IS A NUMBER
      `the costs incurred by the Office of Inspector General in the law enforcement effort resulting in the forfeiture` IS A NUMBER
      `the costs incurred by Federal or State law enforcement agencies in the law enforcement effort resulting in the forfeiture` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `s 2024(f)(4) application of proceeds`
`s 2024(f)(4) the application of the proceeds` MEANS
    `s 2024(f)(4) application of proceeds` OF `to the Department of Justice`, `to the Office of Inspector General`, `to the law enforcement agencies`, `left for the Secretary`
    WHERE
        `to the Department of Justice` MEANS min `the proceeds from any sale of forfeited property and any monies forfeited` `the costs incurred by the Department of Justice to initiate and complete the forfeiture proceeding`
        `to the Office of Inspector General` MEANS min (`the proceeds from any sale of forfeited property and any monies forfeited` MINUS `to the Department of Justice`) `the costs incurred by the Office of Inspector General in the law enforcement effort resulting in the forfeiture`
        `to the law enforcement agencies` MEANS min (`the proceeds from any sale of forfeited property and any monies forfeited` MINUS `to the Department of Justice` MINUS `to the Office of Inspector General`) `the costs incurred by Federal or State law enforcement agencies in the law enforcement effort resulting in the forfeiture`
        `left for the Secretary` MEANS `the proceeds from any sale of forfeited property and any monies forfeited` MINUS `to the Department of Justice` MINUS `to the Office of Inspector General` MINUS `to the law enforcement agencies`
